===Verb===
'''hringja''' (''weak conjugation:'' [[hringdi]] – [[hringt]])

# {{lb|is|with dative}} to [[phone]], to [[call]] almost always used with ''[[í#Icelandic|í]]'' (then followed by accusative)
#* ''[[ég#Icelandic|Ég]] '''hringi''' [[í#Icelandic|í]] [[þig#Icelandic|þig]] [[þegar]] [[ég#Icelandic|ég]] [[vera#Icelandic|er]] [[búinn]] [[með#Icelandic|með]] [[matur|matinn]].''
#*: (lit. I'll '''call''' you when I am done with the food.)
#*:: [[I'll]] '''call''' [[you]] [[when]] [[I've]] [[finished]] [[eating]].
# {{lb|is|with dative}} to [[ring]] (a doorbell)
#* ''[[ætla|Ætlar]] [[þú#Icelandic|þú]] að '''hringja''' ([[dyr]]a)[[bjalla#Icelandic|bjöllunni]].''
#*: [[shall|Shall]] [[you]] '''ring''' the ([[door]])[[bell]]?

